## Coding conventions (high-level)
- Import alias `#/*` maps to `./src/*`
- Prefer the smallest diff that solves the task — no drive-by refactors
- Do not invent scripts, packages, or folder names that aren't in `docs/onboarding/repo-map.md`
- No test script currently exists — do not assume test conventions that aren't there
