## Do-not rules (explicit)
- Never commit `.env` files or secret values, real or placeholder-that-looks-real
- Never hand-edit files produced by `tsr generate`
- Never delete or refactor a file without confirming nothing else imports it
- Never push directly to `upstream` — only to your own fork (`origin`)
- Ask before deleting any file

